# PROJECT OVERVIEW

Design a backend for an AI customer support assistant that: - Answers
questions using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) - Uses a company
knowledge base - Maintains conversation memory per session - Uses Google
Gemini as the LLM - Exposes REST APIs for a future React frontend

